A market in Accra recorded these transactions:
T1: {coffee, eggs, milk, tea}
T2: {eggs, milk}
T3: {coffee, eggs, milk, tea}
T4: {cheese, coffee, eggs, milk}
T5: {coffee, eggs}
T6: {milk, tea}
T7: {coffee, eggs, tea}
T8: {cheese, tea}
For the rule {coffee} → {eggs}, calculate the support and confidence and lift. Interpret the lift.

